<title>USA: Ameriwood Industries Intl Q4 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Ameriwood Industries Intl Q4 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.04     loss	$ 0.60</p>
<p> Net loss		     153     loss	 2,494</p>
<p> Revs			31,320		   26,784</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,286		    4,194</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4, year results include pre-tax charge of $1.2 million or $0.19/shr for product recall costs.</p>
<p>1995 Q4, year include pre-tax charge of about $2.6 million for a management reorganization and environmental remediation.  </p>
<p>			    YEAR</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 0.11     loss	 $0.80</p>
<p> Net profit		   480     loss	 3,368</p>
<p> Revs		     114,547		  105,998</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,255		    4,209</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Ameriwood Industries International Corp.</p>
<p>Prior-period amounts restated to reclassify certain shipping and advertising costs to S,G&amp;A, rather than as a reduction to gross sales.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
